<p>Raw sequencing files and associated metadata have been deposited in NCBI’s Sequence Read Archive (accession SRP098151), <a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sra" class="usa-link" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/sra</a>. LC-MS metabolomics data will be made available on Dryad, <a href="http://datadryad.org" class="usa-link usa-link--external" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">http://datadryad.org</a>/.</p></section></section></section><footer class="p courtesy-note font-secondary font-sm text-center"><hr class="headless">
